the design golden carries an ORDERS table: true
design_orders reproduces every row of Bench_design's ORDERS table: true
an odd round count is refused: true
no arms is refused: true
every source shape is read with its value: true
a request never answered is refused: true
two requests in a row are refused: true
one key resolved to two values is refused: true
the environment and config-file sources each fail the treatment: true
a backend other than the pinned one fails the treatment: true
a profile picked outside the command line fails the treatment: true
an empty trace fails the treatment: true
two cells of one arm resolving a setting differently are reported: true
a well-formed result line is read with its check: true
a non-finite or non-positive result is refused: true
a result that does not state its output check is refused: true
the sign test is exact: true
a clean run exits 0: true
every round runs every arm, in the design's order: true
the planted variables are cleared, by name: true
a device runtime control passes through and is recorded with its value: true
no cell resolved a setting from the environment or a config file: true
the planted settings resolved to their defaults: true
each cell kept its streams in a directory of its own under the output directory: true
each cell's command line is the driver's pins, then the arm's arguments: true
report.md is what was printed: true
## Arms

- common arguments: (none)
- slow: `0.004`
- fast: `0.002` `--ocannl_autotune_timing=isolated`
- design: spread mirrored rotation, 2 arm(s) x 4 rounds; every pair exchanged: true; position histograms equal: true (exact at multiples of 2 rounds); edge visits per arm 4-4

## Times per run (ms)

| variant | arm | n | median | min | max |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| probe | slow | 4 | 4 | 4 | 4 |
| probe | fast | 4 | 2 | 2 | 2 |
| probe_half | slow | 4 | 2 | 2 | 2 |
| probe_half | fast | 4 | 1 | 1 | 1 |

## Paired against slow (ratio = arm / reference, per round)

| variant | arm | pairs | median ratio | range | faster in | sign-test p |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| probe | fast | 4 | 0.500 | 0.500-0.500 | 4 of 4 | 0.125 |
| probe_half | fast | 4 | 0.500 | 0.500-0.500 | 4 of 4 | 0.125 |

What the arms differ by, as resolved:

| setting | slow | fast |
|---|---|---|
| `ocannl_autotune_timing` | queued (default) | isolated (commandline) |

