## Verdict

- every cell clean
a failing cell fails the run: true
## Verdict

- cell 1 (fails): exited 1; reported no bench-result line
- cell 2 (nonfinite): unusable result line: bench-result: {"variant":"probe","seconds":null,"check":"passed","check_note":""}
- cell 3 (nonfinite): unusable result line: bench-result: {"variant":"probe","seconds":null,"check":"passed","check_note":""}
- cell 4 (fails): exited 1; reported no bench-result line
a cell reporting no result fails the run: true
a variant that failed its output check fails the run: true
an unchecked variant is measured, and reported as unchecked with its reason: true
a cell reporting one variant twice fails the run: true
a cell past its cap is recorded as timed out and fails the run: true
a non-empty output directory is refused: true
an output directory inside the checkout is refused: true
duplicate arm labels are refused: true
a malformed arm is refused: true
an odd round count is refused before any cell runs: true
